<title>USA: Liuski says court dismisses lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Liuski says court dismisses lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liuski International Inc said on Monday that the U.S. District Court for the Eastern District of New York has granted the company's motion to dismiss a lawsuit filed by several company shareholders.</p>
<p>The lawsuit was filed in 1994 against the company and certain officers, alleging violations of securities laws, Liuski said.</p>
